About:
~~~~~~

	CallCount is a bulletin maker for the ABBS bulleting board
   system. It generates a bulletin with statistics about the number
   of logins the last couple of days.

   Author: Torge Hjorth
           Olav Tryggvasons gate 6
           N-7011 Trondheim
           NORWAY

	        Byte Bazaar BBS +47 73523117

	(sorry, no email at the moment...)



Usage:
~~~~~~

   CallCount LOGFILES/M/A,BULLETIN/K,DAYS/K/N

   LOGFILES - This option spesifies the logfiles CallCount scan to
              generate the bulletin. Use full path to the logfile.
              This option must be spesified.

   BULLETIN - This is the AmigaDOS filename for the bulletin that
              CallCount generates. Keyword and argument *must* be
              specified.

   DAYS     - How many days you wold like included in the bulletin.
              Keyword and argument *must* be specified.



Example:
~~~~~~~~

CallCount r1.1
Copyright ×1994 Nocturnal Holiday Software, Torge Hjorth.
